{
 "_comment": [
  "THE PROPERTIES OF THE PROPERTY NODE (docs/design/05-decisions.md, DT-072 §3), by class, in the order and",
  "groups of LabVIEW 2026 Q3's menus. A class's menu is its parent's groups and then its own, separated. An item",
  "is a property (`done` with its short name, access and type, or a hole, greyed), a submenu (`submenu`), the",
  "properties of a text object (`of`: Label and Caption, after a Reference row), or a separator. A property's id",
  "is the names of its path joined by ':' (`Label:Text`, `Serial Settings:Baud Rate`); an `All Elements` row is",
  "its submenu's id. `{ \"of\": \"control\" }` is the type of the control the node is linked to.",
  "Measured: labview-captures/reports/2026-10-30-panel-property-node.md, 2026-10-26-visa-property-node.md and",
  "-behavior.md, 2026-10-30-visa-serial-com1.md. `shortVerified: false` and `typeVerified: false` mark what was",
  "not measured yet (a short name or a type taken from VISA Configure Serial Port's terminals)."
 ],
